1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,200
Switch between Personal and Business. A VLTD account. A business name and handle. About 2 minutes.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:13,100
Add a business profile. In Settings, choose + Add business profile.

3
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:22,100
Enter the details. Enter a business name and handle, choose a type, then Create business profile.

4
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:29,100
You are in the Business profile. Settings now shows your Business profile as active.

5
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:36,100
A separate, empty Vault. The Business profile starts with its own empty Vault.

6
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:43,100
Add items to this profile. Items you add or import here stay in the Business profile.

7
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:52,100
Switch profile. Open the account menu and choose a profile under Switch profile.

8
00:00:53,100 --> 00:01:00,100
Your Personal Vault is unchanged. Your Personal Vault shows only your personal items.

9
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:07,000
Personal and Business collections stay separate. Next: add an item to either profile.
